{
  "authority_effect": "NONE",
  "evidence_effect": "NONE",
  "chapter": 94,
  "title": "狠舅贪财强说亲事　刘姥姥报恩护弱女",
  "title_status": "TG工作回目",
  "source": {
    "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
    "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
    "lines": [
      891,
      956
    ],
    "byte_range": [
      35905,
      38625
    ],
    "text_sha256": "c717d2c639b63a84d07d2c819f70d9778dfe25f2501c2c73d80da89922b5d23d"
  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR37/R38/R42\n\n**V-INTERFACES｜**\n- 巧姐得救硬骨架仍来自判词/曲文与旧恩线；\n- W2：`狱庙相逢之日始知遇难成祥，逢凶化吉`在批语附着关系上最自然地增权巧姐线；\n- **D2裁定：当前不采用。94继续用刘氏旧恩现实救援，不增狱庙。**；板儿婚配时机仍开放。巧姐得救必须来自刘姥姥旧恩，但不许神奇大救援。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          896,
          903
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          36026,
          36447
        ],
        "text_sha256": "b4b285a5633cc2383beb306fd469293a9c6fb4bbac8f640a730cdb7cfe097a85"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处",
      "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n王仁先算礼钱；平儿追问家情；贾母一句“人没问明白，礼倒先算清了”；刘姥姥提供空间、饭、劳动网络；巧姐乡下鞋跟、鸡狗、纺车；两句不定词劳动小曲。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          904,
          906
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          36447,
          36682
        ],
        "text_sha256": "135860b221082b18275aafef2bf4205009dafc102d87d8e2ab245aa30453387e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n坏亲事需要从“看似可议”渐露危险；转移出城的实际过程和乡村第一日可更完整。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          907,
          909
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          36682,
          36815
        ],
        "text_sha256": "8310156e43457897c7581c08c8de91705dbdf49b2f6eca8e3404e76dda052615"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n94-S1条件表面不错 → S2平儿逐项核问 → S3只需证明“不对劲”而非人口买卖大阴谋 → S4刘姥姥给空间 → S5小包袱/路费/谁陪 → S6乡下第一日。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          910,
          912
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          36815,
          37029
        ],
        "text_sha256": "af109a504aacd0b27b977e5c2515968bb574e8172efd225f0d65c1880c8341db"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n媒人不是恶魔，只关心说成；王仁贪但不必大反派；乡邻有人好奇、有人嫌娇、有人肯借针线。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          913,
          915
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37029,
          37174
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ff7f8933d12457b3e1a4116e33233eea38b1bbeb08dc3a3f1fa38ca264c267af"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n劳动/纺织属生活；不补田园诗。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          916,
          918
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37174,
          37236
        ],
        "text_sha256": "f1277cd08c4405775b8179f4e1b12766f5c7cb618ec98dc1744b31243940f758"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nG12两句口传小曲保留：\n“线儿长，莫着忙；手一急，线先伤。”\n“伤/断都使得，哪有定词。”不得扩完整民歌。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          919,
          923
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37236,
          37411
        ],
        "text_sha256": "b33028b7f0b527e606407977c3f090996da55b11fb4a26e677192b0e2a0158cc"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n板儿说追鸡改口、巧姐误认平儿、乡下口语保留。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          924,
          926
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37411,
          37496
        ],
        "text_sha256": "88db1e2d2067f8e54e592a1abc92591f4def45307bf377e951b673a615a8821b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n刘姥姥念佛只作民间口语。救命机制仍是旧恩与社会信用。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          927,
          929
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37496,
          37597
        ],
        "text_sha256": "9784dddb703b5999d4b26d6a5fae01d618defd99847da5cb6a4050f0a76ac537"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n媒人、车脚、乡妇、邻里、小贩。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          930,
          932
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37597,
          37662
        ],
        "text_sha256": "f7694a45870f0109fefab7dd0e46b9559d3f93ad31ba3da0a728a9892bcd67e6"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \n钱：小额路费/衣物即可；坏亲事的危险首先从定礼、急办、信息含糊显现。物：小包袱→炕→粗饭→鞋→纺线。信：巧姐本人只知“住几日”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          933,
          935
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37662,
          37872
        ],
        "text_sha256": "23b67b7e92911914f052fc5addfb3743639841fdcd9437fac09d7d9aa0429b40"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "必须保留",
      "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n贾母那句；王仁钱先行；刘姥姥不拿大银；鸡狗纺车；不定词小曲。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          936,
          938
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37872,
          37988
        ],
        "text_sha256": "cb54057cd85d931e7aafa9dc6e198b3ebc75e610f9b0eaf03933e473481526bc"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n真正卖掉再神救；乡村桃花源；把王仁写成庞大拐卖阴谋主谋。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          939,
          941
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          37988,
          38092
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d19db58f4456da5d50604961b87c1908f5730c13104d52b8886f477495dbd426"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n亲事调查与乡居转移需要完整重排，L3。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          942,
          944
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          38092,
          38161
        ],
        "text_sha256": "8f57237bcfb8395933daebd9d8e3d7cbecb8cb38250fff3dee730ae9d5a8ea65"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n6/39刘姥姥线：她的救不是“高贵”，而是贫寒者熟悉生活网络。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          945,
          947
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          38161,
          38271
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ef18ef3ea5a2f54851395574eb0ea01c38b1a952280a5aa14ca97d398c757fb6"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "name": "回前诗",
      "text": "**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
